WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.828
On the hardest test, TSfam, where no RNA family
overlaps with training,

00:00:04.908 --> 00:00:12.292
RPIembeddor reaches an F1 score of about
zero-point-five-nine and an accuracy of about zero-point-six-seven.

00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:16.025
Its ROC area under the curve is zero-point-seven-zero,

00:00:16.105 --> 00:00:22.730
while the competing tools XRPI and IPMiner sit at
zero-point-four-eight and zero-point-five-zero,

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.043
essentially chance.

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.287
In concrete terms,

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:31.370
RPIembeddor correctly labels nearly three thousand
of the positive interactions and over

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.512
five thousand of the negatives,

00:00:33.592 --> 00:00:37.798
whereas XRPI simply predicts almost everything as
interacting.

00:00:37.878 --> 00:00:43.120
The model clearly learns real signal that
generalizes to unseen RNA families.
